<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
    <title>Please wait</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
    <script type="text/javascript" src="/products/assets/challenge-55fc59cbd25be764fb3d81e4cc10280c.js" ></script>
    <style>
    :root{
        --title-color:#013476;
        --button-color:#a3d8f8;
        --header-top:#013476;
        --header-mid:#a3d8f8;
        --bg:#ffffff; /* page background requested white */
        --card:#ffffff;
        --text:#222;
        --muted:#6b7280;
    }
    #application {
        width: 960px;
    }

    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}
    .skip-link{position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden}
    .skip-link:focus{position:static;width:auto;height:auto;padding:8px 12px;background:#111;color:#fff;left:1rem;top:1rem;z-index:1000}

    /* Header: three horizontal stripes */
    .header{display:block}
    .stripe-top{height:27px;background:var(--header-top)}
    .stripe-mid{height:40px;background:var(--header-mid);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;padding-left:45px}
    .stripe-bottom{height:54px;background:#ffffff}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .thieme-logo{display:block;padding-left:15px;padding-right:15px;width:115px;height:31.125px}

    /* Main content column (matches other pages) */
    #content{float:right;width:680px;min-height:500px;padding:1em 0;border-top:1px solid #D9D9D9;box-sizing:border-box}

    /* Card (white box) inside the content column */
    .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid #e6e6e6;padding:18px 26px;display:block}
    .card .content{font-family:Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;color:#000;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;text-align:left}
    .card .content p{margin:0 0 10px 0}
    .card .content a, .card .content a:link, .card .content a:visited { color:#003376 !important; text-decoration: underline; }
    .card .content ul { margin:0 0 10px 1.2em; }
    .card .content li { margin-bottom:6px; }
    .card .content .articleFunctions { margin-top:12px; }

    /* Title styling: left-aligned, less bold, top rule like accessibility page */
    #challenge-title {font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--title-color);text-align:left;margin:0 0 14px 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-weight:400;font-family:Verdana, Geneva, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif}

    .spinner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:68px;height:68px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.04);color:var(--title-color)}
    .footer{margin-top:16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.9rem;text-align:center}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;border:none;background:var(--button-color);color:var(--title-color);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.primary{background:var(--title-color);color:#fff}
    @media (max-width:600px){#content{float:none;width:auto} .stripe-mid{padding-left:12px}}
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<a href="#main" class="skip-link visually-hidden">Top of Page</a>

<header class="header" role="banner">
    <div class="stripe-top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="stripe-mid">
        <a href="/products/all/home.html" class="brand" aria-label="Thieme home">
            <img src="/products/assets/desktop/img/thiemelogo-db985e5ef53f6cd8a707ed19b49085d1.webp" class="thieme-logo" alt="Thieme"/>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="stripe-bottom" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</header>
<div id="application">
    <div id="content" class="page-help">
        <main id="main" role="main">
            <h1 id="challenge-title">Please wait</h1>

            <div class="card" role="region" aria-labelledby="challenge-title">
                <div class="content">
                    <p>This process is protecting Thieme-Connect from malicious requests caused by AI crawlers, botnets and other hostile web agents.<br/><br/>Usually, you should not see this page or only for a very short time.<br/><br/>If this page keeps showing for longer, please <span style="font-weight: bold;">ensure that JavaScript and cookies are enabled in your browser.</span><br/><br/>For help, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@thieme.de">support@thieme.de</a>.</p>
                </div>

                <div id="spinner" class="spinner" aria-hidden="true">
                    <i class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

        </main>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
